From 70f9db10242d00402d01b298e6fac77de989fd20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 11:09:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 007/140] feat(audio): One UI 6 wave visualizer as the audio
 seekbar

The Samsung One UI 6 media-notification wave from 3fa282fc, kept scoped to the seekbar only: when the wavy seekbar toggle is on, the audio player's seekbar renders as a traveling squiggle for the elapsed portion that reacts to the music, a flat dim remainder, and a round playhead dot, flattening smoothly on pause. Seeking stays fully interactive via the transparent Seeker layer. GL visualizers (Blob, Galaxy, Cuboid, Particle) are untouched.
